bench_local30_gen.py generates Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B candidates on the frozen     
hard-30 dataset by making calls to an Ollama server running locally. It uses the
http_call function from the ensemble module to communicate with the local Ollama
endpoint, and saves the generated responses to a JSON file                      
(eval_candidates_local30_hard.json). The script supports resuming from partial  
results in case of interruptions and includes a demo function for offline       
testing.                                                                        

